==Battleground==
*2 [[Inky Doge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*2 [[Doge]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 6.67~8 seconds<sup>200f~240f</sup>.
*1 [[Gory]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Clyde Gory]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Inky Doge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
**1 [[Clyde Gory]] spawns after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

